# Everything a room keeps for itself: settings and API keys, the glossary
# and key terms (which may name members), the recording database, and what
# a running server leaves behind (a log carrying this run's tokens, and the
# record of which process to stop). On a hosted server the shared config
# and one directory per room live here too.
local/

# The same files anywhere else in the checkout, in case one is created by
# hand outside local/. A recorded session holds every word said in the
# room, so it is more sensitive than the glossary.
config.toml
glossary.txt
keyterms.txt
transept.log
transept.pid
sessions.db*
*.wav
*.flac
transcript*.txt
review*.md

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/
.ruff_cache/

# Editors and operating systems
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
*.swp
